  "narrative": "<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Short impact summary</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Educational Agency and Activism in Linguistic Landscape Studies (2024), published by Peter Lang Verlag, has been cited 7 times. Beyond that, it has been downloaded 345 times and has 1 formal review.</p>\n<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Full narrative</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Educational Agency and Activism in Linguistic Landscape Studies by Durk Gorter and Edina Kromp\u00e1k was published by Peter Lang Verlag in 2024. Conceptually, the work connects to Agency (philosophy), Linguistics, Sociology, Geography and Social science.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">OpenAlex records 7 citations. Citations peaked in 2025 with 4 citing works. Notable citing venues include Emotion, space and society, International Journal of Adolescence and Youth and Linguistic Landscape An international journal. They come from 6 countries, led by Germany, Romania and Greece. The citation record includes 1 formal book review.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">It has been downloaded 345 times via OAPEN.</p>",
